sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant B as Browser
 participant R as Laravel Router
 participant M as Middleware
 participant C as Controller
 participant V as Form Request
 participant E as Eloquent
 participant D as Database
 participant I as Inertia
 participant P as Vue Page
 B->>R: HTTP request
 R->>M: Match route and run middleware
 M-->>B: Redirect or reject when blocked
 M->>C: Continue allowed request
 C->>V: Validate submitted input
 V-->>C: Valid data or validation response
 C->>E: Query or create model
 E->>D: SQL operation
 D-->>E: Rows or result
 C->>I: Render Inertia page or redirect
 I-->>B: Inertia payload
 B->>P: Resolve Vue component and props
